<title>USA: American Medserve Corp Q4 net off.</title>
<headline>American Medserve Corp Q4 net off.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.13   profit	 $0.03</p>
<p> Net	 loss	   1,230   profit	   168</p>
<p> Revs			27,556		   14,450</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   9,466		    6,467</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 net results include non-cash, non-recurring charges totaling $1.8 million. Charges relate primarily to the sale of common stock to the company's officers and directors prior to the initial public offering, expenses incurred in connection with the offering and the writeoff of deferred financing costs.</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	  loss	  $0.35   profit	 $0.06</p>
<p> Net	  loss	  2,571   profit	   405</p>
<p> Revs			82,027		   44,049</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,311		    6,467</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for the year ended Dec 31, 1996 include non-cash, non-recurring charges and an extraordinary item totaling $3.5 million. The company's IPO was completed in December 1996 and generated $92.4 million in gross proceeds.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
